# Million-atom ACE performance check only: no integration or heating.
units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p f
read_data /workspace/-/models/ag_ti3sic2_qsgs_1to1/ag_ti3sic2_qsgs.data.gz
pair_style pace
pair_coeff * * /workspace/potential-comparison/mace_fit_data_20261118/sensitivity_Ti_gap_weight/AgCSiTi_B1616_E10000_F1_a0.001_Ti_gap_weight0.05.yace Ti Si C Ag
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes
variable fn atom sqrt(fx*fx+fy*fy+fz*fz)
